# LeakSanitizer suppressions (used by the ASan presets through LSAN_OPTIONS, CMakePresets.json).
#
# Only for uninstrumented third-party libraries; every entry needs a comment with the reason. Never
# suppress our own code (libs/, app/).

# fontconfig keeps parsed configuration data (allocated while QFontDatabase::addApplicationFont
# registers the bundled fonts, ADR-0048) in caches that it never frees; seen in tst_gui.
leak:libfontconfig.so
